    "These are keto-friendly, not zero-carb — whole-food vegetables carry some carbohydrate. Use the free macro calculator to see the net carbs for your exact build, and we'll portion every delivery to your targets.": "Son keto-friendly, no cero carbohidratos — las verduras integrales tienen algo de carbohidrato. Usa la calculadora de macros gratis para ver los carbohidratos netos de tu bowl, y porcionamos cada entrega a tus metas.",
